{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t法甲比賽，巴黎聖日耳門主場兩球淨勝里昂。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n雙方上半場互無紀錄。換邊後，馬約奴在72分鐘接應葛斯傳送後，在禁區外右腳抽射入網，為聖日耳門先開紀錄。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n到84分鐘，尼迪贊圖送出助攻，葛斯在禁區邊亦是右腳建功，為主隊擴大分差。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n巴黎聖日耳門最終贏2:0，在積分榜以8場17分，暫列第一，領先雷恩一分。里昂目前以14分，排第5。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.595725+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:44:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:18:29.928456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T22:58:25.300590+00:00","content_hash":"da07bf16dc1b87983f1480ff71febdea4195a1185efb08ef1bb70c24058c555c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}